### User 1: Tell the bot my name
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "My name is Alice",
  "user_id": "1"
}

### User 1: Ask what is my name
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "what is my name?",
  "user_id": "1"
}

### User 1: Check stored memories
GET http://localhost:8000/api/memories?user_id=1

### User 1: Search memories about name
GET http://localhost:8000/api/memories/search?query=my name&top_k=5&user_id=1

### User 1: Get conversation history
GET http://localhost:8000/api/history?user_id=1
